          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.3.0 · brief-schema: 1\nEXPERIMENTS — nothing leaves without cleanup and approval. An approved idea moves into its flow, in the column of its area; the playground keeps only the kit, this brief, the log and two empty bases.\n1. PURPOSE\n<the idea being explored>\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n<where it would live>\n3. SCREENS (left → right)\n<one line per artboard>\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n<rules it depends on, with file:line>\n5. COPY SOURCE\n<files; mark NEW copy explicitly>\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n<and why>\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\n<UI-n / D-n numbers>\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
